 bound, not a\\n// bypass: no path here mints authority from the holder member.\\nfunc CheckAuthorization(auth AXAuthorization, wantKind AuthorizationKind, lease LeaseView, now time.Time) error {\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1212,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 303,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
