s epoch 0, want an epoch at or above 1\\\")\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-27-\\t}\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-28-\\tif _, err := scalar.ParseUUIDv4(presented.LeaseID); err != nil {\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-29-\\t\\treturn refuse(ErrInvalidArguments, \\\"terminate-stale target lease %q is not a UUIDv4: %v\\\", presented.LeaseID, err)\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-30-\\t}\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-31-\\tif !hasWinner {\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-32-\\t\\treturn refuse(ErrLocalPreconditionFailed, \\\"terminate-stale cannot prove its target is fenced without an established winning lease\\\")\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-33-\\t}\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-34-\\tif winner.Epoch == 0 || !validLeaseID(winner.LeaseID) {\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-35-\\t\\treturn refuse(ErrInvalidArguments, \\\"terminate-stale observation carries no well-formed winning lease\\\")\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-36-\\t}\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-37-\\tif !forceRecovery {\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-38-\\t\\treturn refuse(ErrLocalPreconditionFailed, \\\"terminate-stale requires explicit force recovery\\\")\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-39-\\t}\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-40-\\tif !diagnosticsPreserved {\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-41-\\t\\treturn refuse(ErrLocalPreconditionFailed, \\\"terminate-stale requires preserved diagnostics before termination\\\")\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-42-\\t}\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-43-\\tif presented.SessionID != winner.SessionID {\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-44-\\t\\treturn refuse(ErrLeaseConflict, \\\"terminate-stale target for session %s is not fenced by the winning lease for session %s\\\", presented.SessionID, winner.SessionID)\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-45-\\t}\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-46-\\tif presented.Epoch == winner.Epoch && presented.LeaseID == winner.LeaseID {\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-47-\\t\\treturn refuse(ErrLocalPreconditionFailed, \\\"terminate-stale must not terminate the live winning owner at epoch %d\\\", winner.Epoch)\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-48-\\t}\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-49-\\treturn nil\\ninternal/fencing/terminate.go-50-}\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 4792,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1198,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
