server whose\n2349|stable pane entrypoint is `ax pane SESSION_ID`, while background\n2350|verifies the existing directory without creating it, contacts only the\n2351|already-running authenticated same-user broker and its attested server,\n2352|and a miss — including an absent runtime directory, the ordinary\n2353|post-reboot cold state — returns the typed `capability_unavailable`\n2354|refusal with realm/readiness details, while an existing-but-unsafe\n2355|directory keeps its custody refusal — there is no fallback to direct\n2356|creation, and every background-path `Acquire` test (24/24 by\n2357|mechanical census) arms both a spy spawner and a spy server probe\n2358|that fail the run if either is ever invoked. Attestation is the landed `terminalbackend`\n2359|Reconcile/ResolveEvidence admission consumed as an `Admitted` set\n2360|composed only with generation equality: a missing realm row or a\n2361|stale-generation admission refuses, so a cached observation replayed as\n2362|live authorizes nothing. Every broker, server, and spawner interaction\n2363|runs through injected dependencies, so the suite passes with no tmux\n2364|process anywhere; native Windows refuses every request.\n2365|\n2366|Run the focused tests and coverage with:\n2367|\n2368|```bash\n2369|go test ./internal/tmuxserver -count=1\n2370|go test ./internal/tmuxserver -cover -count=1\n2371|```\n2372|\n2373|Run the narrowing battery (73 narrowing mutants, two supplementary\n2374|additive rows, plus one harmless control) with:\n2375|\n2376|```bash\n2377|PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/tmuxserver/mutant_harness.py\n2378|```\n2379|\n2380|The harness mutates one production file in place, runs the named killer\n2381|through the production entry point, restores the file from backup, and\n2382|reports per-row verdicts with subprocess exits; `AX_MUTANT_VERBOSE=1`\n2383|additionally prints the raw per-plant logs, and `--log-dir` captures one\n2384|raw log per plant. Task validation logs and mutation artifacts are\n2385|attached to `TASK-260830-35urbp`. The package adds no `ax` command, no\n2386|`doctor` result, and no runtime capability claim; the clause-to-test\n2387|matrix with its stated bounds lives in\n2388|[the task evidence map](internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md).\n2389|\n2390|## Ownership reducer properties\n2391|\n2392|The four story-pinned ownership invariants (pinned v0.6.0 Sections 2.2, 5.3,\n2393|and 13.6-13.10) hold as executable property tests over the landed production\n2394|reducers — `sessstate.Reduce` with `Compare` and the union projection,\n2395|`sessrepo.WinningLease` with `ListLeases`, and `fencing.Authorize*`:\n2396|\n2397|1. Union-order independence: every permutation of a union multiset, and every\n2398|   partition into successive unions, projects byte-identically (winner,\n(more lines below)","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
