l green, shared control). AC: 33 of 33 rows (59-91) driven through production entries by named tests. Second-leaf census: Table B 24×21 (10 measured), Table C 90×11 (all unreachable), Table D 90×21 (108 measured), every measured cell with a named test plus an admitting narrowing row; singleton arms bound by B22, engine-normalized status by B23.\n+- Full 30-command suite green firsthand on the frozen tree (gofmt, build, vet, full suite, race gate, cover, all fuzz gates, tracecheck, cataloggen, linux/windows builds, JSON check, board validate, diff check, windows vet); OUTCOME-keyed base-vs-candidate importer comparison clean (base 82 PASS retained, zero regressions). Evidence tarball with raw per-plant logs attached to `TASK-260830-1c28dz`. Candidate UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree.\n+- Process note: a full-suite cover gate failed while the mutant harness was still running in the same tree — the cover run compiled against a planted mutant. Re-ran clean after the harness exited 0. Never run `go test` concurrently with the harness in one worktree.\n+\n+## 2026-09-21\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"LOGBOOK.md","added":15,"removed":6},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
