{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-000000012805","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c620-a10f-77d2-842c-eaf24fab8e2e"},"sequence":12893,"recorded_at":1780531400025781,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"0cdc816d-6145-48a9-a49c-390655512ae9","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"0cdc816d-6145-48a9-a49c-390655512ae9","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"0cdc816d-6145-48a9-a49c-390655512ae9"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Done. TASK-260830-1c28dz handed off to review with all 20 checklist items verified and checked.\n\n**Deliverable:** tmux lifecycle operations (create, attach, status, quiesce, safe-boundary, stop, stale termination, restore) through `Execute` plus the exec/probe adapters and socket bind gate the first leaf declared as this leaf's bound. 33/33 AC rows and 8/8 operations driven through production entries by named tests. Candidate left uncommitted; branch tip still at `1ba06e9`.\n\n**Evidence (attached as task outcomes):**\n- `TASK-260830-1c28dz_conformance-matrix.md` — AC table, 8-of-8 per-op table with call sites, gate × entry census (Tables B/C/D), bounds incl. P3-A disposition, battery\n- `TASK-260830-1c28dz_producer-evidence.tar.gz` (191 entries) — matrix, results, battery log + 176 raw per-plant logs, OUTCOME comparison + both JSON streams + comparator script, full/race/cover/fuzz/board/no-tmux logs\n\n**Verification, all firsthand on the final tree:**\n- Battery: 176/176 as expected (175 KILLED incl. 100 new narrowing rows, shared control SURVIVED)\n- OUTCOME base-vs-candidate: 230/230 base PASS retained (82 top-level), 307 new, zero regressions; tmuxserver has no in-repo importers, so the package comparison is the complete importer set\n- Full suite 45/45, race 45/45 with no DATA RACE, cover 45/45, 17 fuzz gates, tracecheck, cataloggen, linux/windows builds, windows vet, `task-board validate` exit 0 (179 pre-existing other-item notes, none mine)\n- Suite passes with tmux hidden from PATH (537 PASS, 0 skip); zero real-tmux witnesses\n\nTwo process notes: a cover gate failed mid-session because it compiled against a planted mutant while the harness was still running — re-ran clean, and the LOGBOOK records never to run `go test` concurrently with the harness. Checklist item 16 (token-preserving mutant) is vacuous — no gate inspects source text — and is documented as such in the handoff notes.","reason":null}}
